{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_08_end","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_08","title":"月光沉淪","storyCode":"TW-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"5e06c80461fa06e1ad17b5b73fffaefa37cfb17b10f9ee7ec5cadde402345a05","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 8下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負傷的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——長官，你在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負傷的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你負傷了，你可以下來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，這裡傷患很多......再這樣下去，真的沒地方落腳了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜......塔佳娜她怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負傷的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也不清楚，聽說有人在她的面前被燒死，她就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"........哭出來吧，孩子，你沒必要強撐著的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起......但是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"去哭一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"可現在外面還是一片混亂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我去......有我在，還有羅德島的各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"總有辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不......您難道是想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"帶她去休息，我來指揮戰局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"負傷的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"伯父......！答應我！不要去送死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"那是沒有意義的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......連你都說出沒有意義這種話，那可就真沒有意義了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"至少懷著點希望吧......也許事情還有轉機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"給我——讓開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！那些巨像，巨像被粉碎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"這種執著......真是出乎預料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，不該這麼手下留情了，否則我們無法全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你眼中滿是仇恨，和茫然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你在為安托醫生感到憤怒，可那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡每個人背負的東西，都不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"住嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不許你......提她的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"等到饑荒和寒冬來臨，你們還是會戰敗，這是一場無人生還的鬧劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德......會滅亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這不用你說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你在恨誰......？你又想救誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃！又是那個法術——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"減緩了泥岩的法術生效時間......真是奇異的技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你還有餘裕分心？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！放、放開我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該慶幸，如果你再大個幾歲，我會毫不猶豫地砍下你持杖的慣用手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——鈴蘭！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"別想跑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......你只是個醫生，你不該背對敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林——！你還不能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"又一個......戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......真凶，已經被找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"造成這一切的元兇！叛徒畢德曼！就在剛才，已經被羅德島的幹員們帶回了議事廳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，畢德曼......畢德曼沒死？那是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"不要聽他胡言亂語！真凶是誰還重要嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要的是感染者不再被非感染者排擠，窮人不必為貴族賣命！冬靈人可以奪回自己的土地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是整合運動——我們將開啟新的時代——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，塞弗林，這毫無用處......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就殺了我，整合運動，我們痛痛快快打一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......然後呢？寒冬和饑荒依舊可以摧毀這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"反正橫豎都是死路一條......我寧可相信羅德島可以阻止事情變得更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"至少能多活下來一些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你遍體鱗傷，面罩都碎了一半，你的巨像分崩離析，你其實很累了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得出來......我們同病相憐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，借個火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"反正這都是最後一根煙了......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"（動手，現在，不要讓他們有機會救我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——塞弗林·霍索恩，你死後，我會撤離這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是一座幾近荒廢的城鎮，留在這裡，只是等死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你的死，給他們交代。如若他們還想殘害他人，我自會處置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——永別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......這法術，這是什麼力量......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——您、您為什麼......一定要送死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，小姑娘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"您不該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"那就會有更多人死——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！泥岩好像遇到麻煩了！趕緊去幫他！不要讓他們喘息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但他們連巨像都能打碎......這也太......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......乖乖放棄吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"連薩卡茲都失敗了，你們還要靠什麼戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是趁機發洩不滿的話......好啊，我奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我們奉陪到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快啟動剩下的“留聲機”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不懂萊塔尼亞的源石技藝，快去找個萊塔尼亞人......慢著，頭頂那是什麼，無人機！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"別看頭頂！看你背後！有個眼睛通紅的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"......勸你們別亂動哦，灰喉姐可是盯著你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......也別回頭去找灰喉姐的位置，我也盯著你們啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們憤怒，你們保護。這是第幾次了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......呵，你們居然真的贏了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"把武器放下，這次不會放水了，泥岩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......你們這樣會讓他們依舊記恨沃倫姆德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"與任何立場都無關，他們並非真正渴求變革，他們只是把自己的利益凌駕於其他人之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他們沒有選擇共渡難關，也不願意知曉真相，他們只想要......在混亂中掠奪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜小姐說的對，即使你犧牲自己，也是徒勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不管背後的問題多麼複雜，羅德島的幹員絕不會坐視感染者......毀掉一座城鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......一座安托想要保護的城鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的行動小隊將死守這處廣場，這座議事廳大樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，也許這會造成更多的傷亡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但那是在這之後，在“你們”，和“我們”之後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們還在，就必須抗爭到最後一刻......為了讓安托，瞑目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者們","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們，確實戰勝了我......也許你們確實可以死守這座塔樓......但意義是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人都會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"會像安托一樣......死得毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者有抗爭的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"理由永遠會被正當化......但至少現在，你們沒有在解決問題，你們只是在破壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"在沃倫姆德遭受天災之後，在補給告急缺乏人手的現在......你們做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我啊，你們做了什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——我說過了，別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你的源石技藝已經漏洞百出，現在這個距離，即使只是我的弩箭也足夠讓你失去行動能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼導致了那場火災，那場火災又導致了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......罪魁禍首，已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——我們撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者們","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？但我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"只是小部分的人的話......有辦法穿過大裂谷，回到溫暖的地帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你們是想要奪回土地還是報復富人......最後都只會在凍土上遇難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是想靠怒火度過冬天，還是想靠無辜者的屍體生火取暖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"既然真凶已死，那麼我們理應撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但我們要搶奪的是沃倫姆德！是我們的土地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，冬靈人。你想要的只是權利，舒舒服服地躲在強者後面撿破爛的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不要質疑領袖，學聰明點，否則就把你丟在廢土上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是你一句話就能解決的！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我們死了這麼多人！難道就因為幾句話就要夾著尾巴離開嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓他安靜，朋友們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘎嗷嗷嗷——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——唔啊啊啊——這——拳頭——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"從地底伸出的石拳......你還有餘力嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不要用這麼激烈的手段制止他們，至少剛才為止他們和我們還是一邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來只想嚇他們一下的......算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別老是把自己的源石技藝造物叫做朋友啊，聽起來怪可怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可以當沒聽見。別這麼囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，撤退是我的判斷。我沒有命令你們所有人的能力，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我會離開。願意跟隨我的人也會離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人......你們自求多福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"對了......你有火柴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒受潮的話，剛才那幾個術師可真麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"給那邊的塞弗林長官，遞個火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"戰敗者......能活著退出戰場，已是萬幸，不要再磨蹭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！那就不要管什麼整合運動了！打下議事廳是遲早的事，這座城鎮需要我們做主——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"投降吧，塞弗林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我就說，他們不會輕易收手的，咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"注意左側！他們來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，躲在我身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......一群瘋子，嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對，不允許你們，踐踏羅德島保護的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在準備施法，準備防禦，擊破施術者——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼？擋下了我的源石技藝？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你們為什麼要來礙事——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——領袖有令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"就算要和你們打，我們也不會輕易放棄，魔族！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......嚯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了，他們怎麼起了內訌......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......泥岩他......停下了腳步？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......土壤啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"站......起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，泥岩，你在縮短自己的壽命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要使用那麼古老的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了......站起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾乎所有的廢墟都凝結在一起。\n那是一個巨人，它遙望著遠方的山脈。\n他，泥岩，一動不動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好高！好大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......強弩之末罷了，它的身軀在崩潰，他在勉強自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"後退，不要貿然進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對......泥岩的確已經沒有這個力氣了，但是這法術......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"這其中有著薩卡茲的......巫術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"（我說了——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做一件很危險的事情，你把你的生命分享給了自己的造物，如果只是為了威懾，這不值得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......行吧，聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"（從仇恨和紛爭裡脫身，活下去，現在是離開這裡的最後機會。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"（還想戰鬥的人......就是想將所有人置於死地。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩石巨像","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......先來摧毀我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"先來打敗......我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"他、他怎麼......他不是來幫我們的人嗎！他不是整合運動嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......我、我才不管！那就讓他去死吧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"過去......我們幫助你們。因為那場火災，我們都心懷憤懣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們認同你們，引導你們，我們追求的不是他們的死，而是我們的生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，現在，我們似乎不站在同一邊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......殺害平民和羅德島的戰士，讓我們心有憂慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果是對付不聽命令的暴徒......我們何必手下留情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"對付任何人，我們，薩卡茲，“魔族佬”，都綽綽有餘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"綽綽有餘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？自從那個巨像出現之後，聲音就停下了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"那個、山一樣的巨像也是源石技藝嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......想辦法和亞葉她們會合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁！該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我們走，這座城鎮已經死了，在冬天來臨前找到翻過大裂谷的路才能活下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"放棄這座城鎮吧，冬靈的同胞，窮人和感染者們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"自會有別處迎接我們的怒火，就讓沃倫姆德坐以待斃吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"......在這裡和薩卡茲衝突也沒有任何好處，撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊——哈、哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經停手了......真荒唐，我們怎麼變成了勸架的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這座城鎮......我們，帶來了混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"非你我本意，但抗爭本就是利己的，沒有那麼多人心懷什麼偉大事業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對......那我們究竟要如何對待我們的鬥爭......以及死去的同胞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦和糾葛時刻伴隨著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，等我一下......我好像摸著火柴了，備用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，憲兵，接著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......薩卡茲的戰士也會抽煙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我已經戒煙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯，看來每個戒煙的人都會帶著火柴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......撿來的命，好好珍惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你們，羅德島......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼，就此別過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......也許你們能想辦法幫助剩下的這些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些事，都和薩卡茲無關了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在岩石的崩塌聲中，薩卡茲們轉過了頭。\n街道在燃燒。\n暴徒離去，沒有再發生衝突的唯一原因，僅僅是恐懼和威懾。\n最後一塊碎石落地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_294_ayer","aliases":["斷崖"]},{"speakerId":"char_328_cammou","aliases":["卡達"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
